      "content": "Okay, I think I get the part about the legal fees now. But it still feels a bit risky. Are there any specific red flags or \"hidden\" things I should look for in these types of clauses that might make them even more dangerous for a freelancer? Like, is there anything that could turn a standard clause into something much worse?",
